      "created_at": "2012-10-12T18:44:59.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hey, Sentinels of the Forum-verse!</p><p>Adam and I are finishing up the comic today, but we need a letters page! Are you familiar with the letters page in the back of comic books? That kind of thing!</p><p>So! Give me some letters! Questions to answer! Mind you, they need to be about the comics, not the game. They can be about things that happened in certain \"panels\" (the art from cards through-out the games), or questions directly to any of the creators! Or even to characters within the game!</p><p>You can mail them to me, or just post them here! Send me your letters!</p><p>SEND ME YOUR LETTERS!</p>",
